# CR 510.4: Serra Zealot (1/1, First Strike) attacks; Devoted
# Hero (1/2, no keywords) blocks -- the same shape
# combat-first-strike-prevents-return-damage already proves, run again
# against a different corpus attacker.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged attacker to the graveyard.
advance
